### 查询学生
GET http://localhost:8081/students

### 新增学生
POST http://localhost:8081/students

### 修改学生
PUT http://localhost:8081/students

### 删除学生
DELETE http://localhost:8081/students

### 根据ID查询学生
GET http://localhost:8081/students/1002

### 使用查询参数查询学生
GET http://localhost:8081/student?id=1002

### 新增学生（JSON请求体）
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1003,
  "name": "王五",
  "age": 21
}

### 正常学生
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1003,
  "name": "王五",
  "age": 21
}

### 姓名为空
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1004,
  "name": "",
  "age": 21
}

### 年龄小于最小值
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1005,
  "name": "李四",
  "age": -5
}

### 年龄超过最大值
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1006,
  "name": "赵六",
  "age": 200
}

### 学生年龄不能为空
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1011,
  "name": "王五"
}

### 测试年龄错误
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
"id": 1012,
"name": "赵六",
"age": -5
}